<b>Poop Throw  

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:32.870
They love wet, clammy, slimy places!

00:22:33.370 --> 00:22:35.990
There would be lots of them in the sewer!

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:39.570
Oh, dear, they'd get all tangled up in hair!

00:22:41.470 --> 00:22:45.470
Emperor Bagramon's Day of Ultimate 
