human world will be destroyed!

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:51.280
We'll put everything on 
the line to stop Bagramon!

00:22:51.280 --> 00:22:52.320
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.400
<b>The Bagra Brothers' Bond of Darkness!</b>

00:22:52.320 --> 00:22:54.450
You can't turn your back 
on the next one, either!
